{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"JobPosting","title":"Marketing Manager","description":"<p> </p><p><strong> Job Title: Marketing Manager</strong></p><p><strong>Department:</strong> Marketing<br /> <strong>Location:</strong> Deccan, Pune<br /> <strong>Employment Type:</strong> Full-time<br /> <strong>Working</strong>- 6 days<br /> <strong>Experience: </strong>5+ years relevant experience. <br /> <strong>Date of joining</strong>: 1st to 5th August 2026. <br /> <strong>Qualification</strong>: MBA marketing through reputed college. <br /> <strong>Relevant Experience:</strong> Proven experience in marketing service-based businesses and e-commerce platforms.</p><p><strong>Role Overview</strong></p><p>The Senior Manager - Marketing is responsible for developing and executing the company's overall marketing strategy to drive brand awareness, customer acquisition, engagement, and revenue growth. This leadership role oversees all marketing functions, including brand management, digital marketing, content, communications, product marketing, and demand generation.</p><p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p><p><strong>Strategic Leadership</strong></p><ul><li>Develop and implement the company's marketing vision, strategy, and marketing plans. </li><li>Align marketing initiatives with business objectives and growth targets. </li><li>Identify customer insights and brand positioning strategies. </li><li>Lead go-to-market planning for new services and market expansions. </li></ul><p><strong>Brand & Communications</strong></p><ul><li>Build and strengthen the company's brand identity and market presence. </li><li>Oversee public relations, media relations, and corporate communications. </li><li>Ensure consistency of brand messaging across all channels. </li></ul><p><strong>Demand Generation & Growth</strong></p><ul><li>Drive customer acquisition, retention, and revenue growth through multi-channel campaigns. </li><li>Optimize digital marketing channels, including SEO, SEM, social media, email marketing, and paid advertising. </li><li>Develop lead-generation strategies and improve conversion rates across the marketing funnel. </li></ul><p><strong>Team Leadership</strong></p><ul><li>Build, mentor, and manage marketing team. </li><li>Set clear goals, KPIs, and performance expectations. </li><li>Foster a culture of creativity, collaboration, and data-driven decision-making. </li></ul><p><strong>Analytics & Performance</strong></p><ul><li>Establish and monitor marketing KPIs and ROI metrics. </li><li>Analyze campaign performance and customer behaviour to optimize results. </li><li>Prepare regular reports and recommendations for executive leadership. </li></ul><p><strong>Budget & Vendor Management</strong></p><ul><li>Manage marketing budgets and allocate resources effectively. </li><li>Evaluate and manage external agencies, vendors, and strategic partners. </li><li>Ensure marketing investments deliver measurable business outcomes. </li></ul><p><strong>Required Qualifications</strong></p><ul><li>Bachelor's degree in Marketing, Business Administration, Communications, or related field. </li><li>Proven experience in marketing service-based businesses and e-commerce platforms.</li><li>Proven track record of developing and executing successful marketing strategies. </li><li>Strong knowledge of digital marketing, branding, demand generation, and analytics. </li><li>Experience managing cross-functional teams and marketing budgets. </li><li>Excellent communication, leadership, and stakeholder management skills. </li></ul><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ul><li>Bachelors/ Master's degree (Degree in marketing preferred). </li><li>Experience in service-based businesses and e-commerce platforms </li><li>Familiarity with marketing automation, CRM platforms, and analytics tools. </li><li>Experience scaling marketing functions in high-growth organizations. </li></ul><br /><ul><li><strong>key Skills</strong></li><li>Strategic Planning & Bran